# Chest caught with a bait of wind (Q027), refused: a level 26 character, one short of the quest's
# level, is turned away by Lanosco even with the special bait quest done. Expectations replay the
# reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q027_chest_caught_with_a_bait_of_wind_low_level.golden
character Angler 26
quest Q050_LanoscosSpecialBait <state>=COMPLETED
script quest.Q027_ChestCaughtWithABaitOfWind
script quest.Q050_LanoscosSpecialBait
item 6500 7625 880
page fisherman/31570.htm
page script/quest/Q027_ChestCaughtWithABaitOfWind/
